abstract: "Multilevel, multichannel R-matrix calculation of differential cross sections for low-energy nuclear reactions: elastic and inelastic scattering with Coulomb and nuclear interference, Blatt-Biedenharn angular distributions, bound and sub-threshold levels with Whittaker closed-channel boundary conditions, and a resonance finder."
